    <innernamespace refid="namespaceasyncdb">asyncdb</innernamespace>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Implementation for asyncdberror. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This file implements the three error-classification helpers. isBusy() first recognises our own <ref refid="classDatabaseBusy" kindref="compound">DatabaseBusy</ref> exception and then looks for a few telling words in the error text (such as &quot;timeout&quot; or &quot;pool&quot;). toHttpStatus() turns that answer into an HTTP code, and throwIfBusy() re-raises the project&apos;s <ref refid="classDatabaseBusy" kindref="compound">DatabaseBusy</ref> type so the shared HTTP error handler can produce a 503 response.</para>
<para>WHY THIS FILE MATTERS IN THE SERVER: Every coroutine-based database method in <ref refid="classDatabaseController" kindref="compound">DatabaseController</ref> catches a plain std::exception when a query fails. This file is what lets those methods tell a temporary overload apart from a real bug. Because both the old synchronous pool and the new async path end up producing the same <ref refid="classDatabaseBusy" kindref="compound">DatabaseBusy</ref> exception, the HTTP layer needs only one rule for answering 503 with Retry-After. Without this file, async database failures would all look alike and temporary outages would be reported as permanent server errors.</para>
<para>CONCEPTS TO LEARN (for beginners):<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Exceptions and catching by base class: <ulink url="https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/error/exception">https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/error/exception</ulink></para>
</listitem><listitem><para>dynamic_cast (runtime type check): <ulink url="https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/language/dynamic_cast">https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/language/dynamic_cast</ulink></para>
</listitem><listitem><para>std::string::find and npos: <ulink url="https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/string/basic_string/find">https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/string/basic_string/find</ulink></para>
</listitem><listitem><para>HTTP 503 status: <ulink url="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Status/503">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Status/503</ulink></para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Drogon DbClient: <ulink url="https://drogon.docsforge.com/master/database/">https://drogon.docsforge.com/master/database/</ulink></para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="author"><para>Amr Osman <ulink url="mailto:dr3mro@gmail.com">dr3mro@gmail.com</ulink> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="date"><para>2026-11-16 </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
